pport medical necessity and provide coverage for CPT/HCPCS codes: 11055, 11056, 11057, 11719, 11720, 11721, and G0127 for anticoagulation therapy."},"noncovered":{"1":"All those not listed under the &ldquo;ICD-10 Codes that Support Medical Necessity&rdquo; section of this article."}}}]